sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Applicant
    participant UI as Web App
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    actor IM as Institution Manager
    actor PA as Platform Admin

    %% --- UNIVERSITY CREATION FLOW ---
    IM->>UI: Start onboarding
    UI->>IM: Show setup steps (details, bio, images, location, benefits, scholarships)
    IM->>UI: Submit university + programs
    UI->>API: Create university (status: Pending)
    API->>DB: Store university + programs
    API-->>UI: Success (Pending Approval)

    %% --- PLATFORM APPROVAL ---
    PA->>UI: View pending universities
    UI->>API: Fetch pending listings
    API->>DB: Query pending
    DB-->>API: Listings
    API-->>UI: Show list

    PA->>UI: Approve / Reject listing
    UI->>API: Update status
    API->>DB: Save status (Approved)
    API-->>UI: Confirmation

    %% --- APPLICANT FLOW ---
    Applicant->>UI: Browse universities
    UI->>API: Fetch approved universities
    API->>DB: Query approved
    DB-->>API: Data
    API-->>UI: Show listings

    Applicant->>UI: View university + programs

    %% --- APPLICATION FLOW ---
    Applicant->>UI: Start application
    UI-->>Applicant: Stepper form (Personal, Academic, Documents, Review)

    loop Fill Steps
        Applicant->>UI: Enter data
        UI->>API: Save draft
        API->>DB: Store draft
    end

    Applicant->>UI: Submit application
    UI->>API: Submit
    API->>DB: Save (status: DRAFT → REVIEWED)
    API-->>UI: Submission success

    %% --- APPLICATION REVIEW ---
    IM->>UI: View applications
    UI->>API: Fetch applications
    API->>DB: Query by university
    DB-->>API: Applications
    API-->>UI: Show list

    IM->>UI: Open application
    UI->>API: Fetch details
    API->>DB: Get full application
    API-->>UI: Show profile

    IM->>UI: Update status
    Note right of IM: REVIEWED → APPROVED / REJECTED / WAITLISTED / WITHHELD
    UI->>API: Update application status
    API->>DB: Save status + log

    %% --- STATUS TRACKING (TIMELINE) ---
    Applicant->>UI: View application status
    UI->>API: Fetch status history
    API->>DB: Get status logs
    API-->>UI: Timeline data
    UI-->>Applicant: Show timeline (status progression)